  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PRSP i BiH</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PRSP in BiH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det f&#xF6;rsta &quot;Poverty Reduction Strategy Paper&quot; f&#xF6;r BiH kom ut i juni 2000. Processen f&#xF6;r att genomf&#xF6;ra f&#xF6;rslagen och att omarbeta den p&#xE5;g&#xE5;r hela tiden. Denna insats g&#xE4;ller att inkludera akt&#xF6;rerna i n&#xE4;ringslivssektorn i processen, b&#xE5;de lokala och internationella. Ansvarig organisation &#xE4;r &quot;Ministry for Trade adn Economic Relations i Federationen, BiH.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The first draft of a Poverty Reduction Strategy Paper in  Bosnia-Hercegovina was produced in June 2000. There is an ongoing process to formulate the PRSP and to implement the suggestions in it. In this memo EVB suggests that Sida should finance the inclusion of the actors in the private sector in the formulating of the PRSP and in the implementation of the suggested measures.</narrative>
  </description>
